+/*
+ * Emit a convex polygon as a list of triangles fanning out from vertex 0.
+ *
+ * Texture coordinates are per vertex, already normalised to the
+ * power-of-two texture size. Vertices sit on pixel edges and the 3D
+ * engine samples at pixel centres, like OpenGL, so a texture coordinate
+ * computed at a pixel edge lands on texel centres with no extra offset.
+ */
 static void
